61
00:05:01.770 --> 00:05:04.550
Kuradi kurat ei saanud kätte.

62
00:05:04.650 --> 00:05:07.489
Ära annus.

63
00:05:07.589 --> 00:05:11.960
Vabandust, aga tead, kole on see,
mis metsas tooma hakkab,

64
00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:15.790
