124
00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:42.685
Kirbu honnik.

125
00:12:53.860 --> 00:12:57.970
Enne kui mets pole kellerkottidest
vaba, sa teisi linde

126
00:12:57.970 --> 00:13:01.860
