127
00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:04.710
Varsti võid sa ise abi vajada.

128
00:13:07.179 --> 00:13:09.479
Aita, palun.

129
00:13:16.840 --> 00:13:21.640
Vabandus aitäh, aitäh,
kulla prügihunt. Ma kartsin, et ma

130
00:13:21.640 --> 00:13:24.329
