kõrvale, ma loen sulle kohe ette.

151
00:15:04.740 --> 00:15:08.190
Need on väga head laused.

152
00:15:08.290 --> 00:15:10.800
Oled sa valmis?

153
00:15:10.900 --> 00:15:12.030
Nii

154
00:15:12.130 --> 00:15:13.380
hea küll,

155
00:15:13.480 --> 00:15:19.000
